        </name>
        <questiontext format="html">
            <text><![CDATA[
<p class="HELM_exercise">
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        Exercise
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Übung
    </span>
</p>
<p>
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        Solve the following equations.
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Lösen Sie die folgenden Gleichungen.
    </span>
</p>
<ol class="HELM_parts">
    <li>
        <p>
            <span class="multilang" lang="en">
                \( {@a1@}-{@b1@}({@c1*t@}+{@d1@}) = {@e1*(f1*t+g1)@}\), therefore \(t=\)
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="de">
                \( {@a1@}-{@b1@}({@c1*t@}+{@d1@}) = {@e1*(f1*t +g1)@}\), also \(t=\)
            </span>
            [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]
        </p>
    </li>
    <li>
        <p>
            <span class="multilang" lang="en">
                \( {@a5*m - b5 + a5*(m- b5) = m@}\), therefore \(m=\)
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="de">
                \( {@a5*m - b5 + a5*(m- b5) = m@}\), also \(m=\)
            </span>
            [[input:ans5]] [[validation:ans5]] [[feedback:prt5]]
        </p>
    </li>
    <li>
        <p>
            <span class="multilang" lang="en">
                \( \displaystyle {@(1/a6)@}({@x@} + {@b6@}) = {@c6@}\), therefore \(x=\)
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="de">
                \( \displaystyle {@(1/a6)@}({@x@} + {@b6@}) = {@c6@}\), also \(x=\)
            </span>
            [[input:ans6]] [[validation:ans6]]
                                                [[feedback:prt6]]
        </p>
    </li>
</ol>
]]></text>
